#: omake:omake_8F3B5A95_060E_4BAC_972A_F08911B67416
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 877b385914268b924cca8a9150e8bee895fe50d1abe12c2cfb7873cde6166edd
#. default-sha256: 3a1deb03095758bd9178a9b768aefa14b0c093553eee26966be92f162f28afb6
msgctxt "omake:omake_8F3B5A95_060E_4BAC_972A_F08911B67416"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The fact that you’re here means you’ve uncovered all the mansion’s mysteries, yes?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫ここまで辿り着いたということは、⟪k:2⟫屋敷の謎を解き明かしたんでしょう？"

#: omake:omake_33DB8421_3078_4DDB_BCC8_CC85C82A31C9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 56466b9178647aaefc323133ed9ebf2a41faaeb7694684fc97c28f08a5b92283
#. default-sha256: d6ada6592f1a471d421f91c36fa603c65c0083a66006a266dab5642cda031a64
msgctxt "omake:omake_33DB8421_3078_4DDB_BCC8_CC85C82A31C9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hehe... ⟪k:2⟫My congratulations for having the fortitude to endure such a... ⟪k:3⟫grim "
"tale."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……フフ……、⟪k:2⟫褒めてあげるわ。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫少なくとも、⟪k:5⟫陰惨な物語に耐えるだけの力はあ"
"るようですから。"

#: omake:omake_D63F2895_E50C_46E2_9865_90EE7DAEF191
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c62a9363634847b4a88bce0611a1741d4b95fe680a1fe7e1f0e82deb520304a3
#. default-sha256: 4cf8ff750e4a7bae3d8911290b1f0d6aab258788f78b487ce68b5380b587535c
msgctxt "omake:omake_D63F2895_E50C_46E2_9865_90EE7DAEF191"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫That is, if you’re willing to take this hand."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫こんな手でも、⟪k:3⟫取れるというのならね。"

#: omake:omake_A617AD89_AEC1_4805_99EF_AA6B38AE5A1E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 891c6761a7fe4793cae3d68b694291f03f4524411eabc25ba43040d82da4bc1c
#. default-sha256: b349b14437cf1efa4bf632ae7f6dfecf0694f72fe207dc993382e6210aa5632f
msgctxt "omake:omake_A617AD89_AEC1_4805_99EF_AA6B38AE5A1E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫That said, I would prefer not to have to guide you around the house all by myself. ⟪k:2⟫"
"Not because I have anything in particular against you, of course."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫でも、⟪k:2⟫私とあなただけで屋敷の中は回りたくないわね。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫別に、⟪k:5⟫あなたが嫌い"
"というわけじゃなくてね。"

#: omake:omake_DA265B35_DB52_473A_9DE9_B33FBA039094
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3b76789ff154dd5cf9d56a902c6ae0f52e4929400369509b534b7cc7b7b1ca61
#. default-sha256: 7fbd0e188ab6e67181bca4e97e10b13f2f5e29f3bdadf3f6a27d1dca9d54df74
msgctxt "omake:omake_DA265B35_DB52_473A_9DE9_B33FBA039094"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I simply think it would be inappropriate for him not to accompany us—⟪k:2⟫yes, him. "
"This story’s protagonist."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫やっぱりここは……、⟪k:2⟫彼も一緒に来るべきでしょう？⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ええ、⟪k:5⟫この作品の……“主"
"人公”もね。"

#: omake:omake_0794DE9D_FE35_4A86_8F75_5AD32CE22656
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ee4e212bf5abc7ef0c2c1fd5b44924cdfa1bdcc11c8e7ceee52147dab7fe9bd3
#. default-sha256: fce675af2b55a3759a15d8fbadaab24e8ee9925fb06cadd8c8b34d9bb6fc1e81
msgctxt "omake:omake_0794DE9D_FE35_4A86_8F75_5AD32CE22656"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫D-⟪k:2⟫Don’t worry! When I was in her position, I closed my eyes and plugged my ears "
"when you were doing your business!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫あっ、⟪k:2⟫大丈夫ですよ！　⟪k:3⟫わたしの時は、⟪k:4⟫ちゃんと目を閉じて耳を塞いでましたか"
"ら！"

#: omake:omake_C86A283F_EF5F_4910_9E27_FEEE835E9822
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cc071436ef33b22df253338eedb7488f691210da42c79a42ade2459fcb972393
#. default-sha256: 216c2185406fa03f6ca343ce525e5a483cdd438126aabdd8b718f3d0afca2cc5
msgctxt "omake:omake_C86A283F_EF5F_4910_9E27_FEEE835E9822"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫In some ways, you could call the first four chapters an extended prologue."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ある意味長い序章だったわね。"

#: omake:omake_04EFEC16_E072_4AAB_8F7F_27F92146FDB2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6ed2fafeec45ea0b46ea5a319e51f652db33ff1b61f11b186a21749bf96891eb
#. default-sha256: b1e0ce50d11a35b3976ed311ab4b19d46eae7c344679bae2a084095f9823584b
msgctxt "omake:omake_04EFEC16_E072_4AAB_8F7F_27F92146FDB2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Aww! What about me?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫ええっ、⟪k:2⟫なんでですかぁ！"

#: omake:omake_FAE92C38_A7AE_47BC_988B_8D0A204B48A5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 58fa5d8521c02bab1cf9de285fa98d354ba60e593f4bfc59932996d467a1ce7a
#. default-sha256: d752ad2c34e5bf10a13df0b4b515553648f32c40753f34b63ac5009d6f39d21b
msgctxt "omake:omake_FAE92C38_A7AE_47BC_988B_8D0A204B48A5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Because with you around, he turns into a lovesick, airheaded dope. ⟪k:3⟫He’s about "
"as useful to me as a wet paper sack full of potatoes."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ジゼルの傍にいると、⟪k:3⟫ただの色ボケぼんやり野郎にしかならないからよ。⟪k:4⟫締まら"
"ないったらないわ。"

#: omake:omake_01DFD587_996F_4535_AD66_8069416148E1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b0bc5ef561bceaf1fb1f4560ec869afea9dafab9969df4d12e0170de7b4bd324
#. default-sha256: ea429d6b3c43593d9479e8b40beecdc7226f65dff35f9219e998bad7bd45e240
msgctxt "omake:omake_01DFD587_996F_4535_AD66_8069416148E1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Absolutely not.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You spoil him—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫in more ways than one."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫だめよ、⟪k:3⟫あなたはすぐに彼を甘やかすんだから。"

#: omake:omake_00458DC6_24DD_49A1_9A44_7913F792FA41
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a04f068040c7301a5532e3b0b9760709b40a17a0371125147a6412740d5e3d6b
#. default-sha256: 971f20e756410d3bafd50a8bbd881a7e97883f81fcb41fb4a6cb2ce68119537e
msgctxt "omake:omake_00458DC6_24DD_49A1_9A44_7913F792FA41"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫What are we going to do, though?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫しかし、⟪k:2⟫外に出て何をするんだ……？"

#: omake:omake_0A87396A_6CA3_4EBB_A1DC_2E718908DE9B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a069033e2223ba494e6c1859f753a9c8a34b083e4a2c96b9b7b5d8aafcf75153
#. default-sha256: d504079e68d3a521d6fc9315b7231c87a766dd6bc4dc8762a5cead7f48a09db7
msgctxt "omake:omake_0A87396A_6CA3_4EBB_A1DC_2E718908DE9B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I seem to recall plenty of faffing about in the main game anyway;⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫why "
"don’t we do something we ⟪k:5⟫couldn’t⟪k:6⟫ do there?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫しかし言いたい放題するなら本編でもやったことだし、⟪k:2⟫舞台裏ならではの別のことをした方"
"が良いんじゃないのか。"

#: omake:omake_3270FD07_2CA5_4EB1_A3EC_A58FAF8F9135
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c32d0af8f6951e033e053322fd34ba03e8129e09520784f11c8f90531491ff9b
#. default-sha256: 9fc756ebe2c2ffde1668ea0e803c727d867763f32fa87baf4286420958e46bc8
msgctxt "omake:omake_3270FD07_2CA5_4EB1_A3EC_A58FAF8F9135"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫They’ve got profiles and other miscellaneous notes from the creators about each of the "
"characters. ⟪k:2⟫I thought they might come in handy."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫製作者たちの、⟪k:2⟫各キャラに対する設定とかあれやこれが駄々漏れしてるカンペです。⟪k:3⟫こ"
"れを持っていったらいいんじゃないかしら。"

#: omake:omake_D9720B49_BE4B_4233_AD85_F5EE3AB8852A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 64feb9cf859da351ed32088eb48ecf1627af554ba7a08e71d3c592c4fa638abf
#. default-sha256: 027558402a660f1fa811973eef69ac23f48ea2a233e1c50e4f76a3bc8ee6fa4b
msgctxt "omake:omake_D9720B49_BE4B_4233_AD85_F5EE3AB8852A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I can see them being useful, yes...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫but why exactly do you ⟪k:4⟫have⟪k:5⟫ "
"those?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……それは良いとして……、⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫どうして君がそんなものを持っているんだ……？"

#: omake:omake_B908C0B0_A59E_4A40_A466_5B4855F5E803
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 033909a1db4bbdbc1673c548b31e16ab8df686a8297d6768cd23efc72659b55b
#. default-sha256: fb0de2bc6e885fe6cda8ef13441fdfbdeb878566ecdcf7d850efa94d83c1ab79
msgctxt "omake:omake_B908C0B0_A59E_4A40_A466_5B4855F5E803"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(I’d rather pretend those miniaturized ⟪k:2⟫things⟪k:3⟫ were not actually us...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫（あの小さい奴らは我々だと思いたくないけどな……）"

#: omake:omake_0410FEE1_869D_46D3_9374_1966D808C9F3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ee3dd22c80ee6bfb7681aed681d858dcad1fb0b5e3da26be6793e1fd0028f4c9
#. default-sha256: 652f646f78ac17b9ded1a03e86e845a60f20d213d83ba89841dca0e8dbbbe3d2
msgctxt "omake:omake_0410FEE1_869D_46D3_9374_1966D808C9F3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hand over the cue cards."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫それじゃ、⟪k:3⟫カンペ借りるわね。"

#: omake:omake_4043095C_4868_46C9_9D44_88A2E7235295
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ee53512e32f63adf4618742912221010bf04ca4c4689c3ab6eaab782f46e2643
#. default-sha256: 001926adff6e8a22c381914f7bbe1dc6ff49461cca67aeed35bae01ae9207623
msgctxt "omake:omake_4043095C_4868_46C9_9D44_88A2E7235295"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The second chapter was pretty crazy too!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫When we found out about, ⟪k:5⟫"
"uh, ⟪k:6⟫Ukulele, that was it!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫二章のあの人もすごかったですよね、⟪k:3⟫ほら、⟪k:4⟫ウキマサさん！"

#: omake:omake_FB1C8C58_BDE7_4C25_A96D_8C079BBFE140
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0f8fa93e06d373c83b57b68257d7684794c101c62465727fc80ed473f5a748db
#. default-sha256: 876ed379720767a4b922feffe401107cc7955857e9813c9740eb9dd2f63b5252
msgctxt "omake:omake_FB1C8C58_BDE7_4C25_A96D_8C079BBFE140"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫A-⟪k:1⟫Ahaha.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Chapter three was something else too.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫My impression of "
"Jacopo and Maria had completely turned around by the end."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫あ、⟪k:1⟫あはは。⟪k:2⟫三章もそういう意味では、⟪k:3⟫ヤコポさんもマリーアさんも、⟪k:4⟫最後で印"
"象が変わってきますよね。"

#: omake:omake_54FAF5B0_AB1F_4D4B_8DD6_4EB27BAB9EC3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0ac5e72d5874982671e67eba95d1831e4690919b468f36f73d5b6b4f342db279
#. default-sha256: 1991f6cf04df31330e8d4977aa0229772ac2f4d614eeb97bbb21c05d82880ab6
msgctxt "omake:omake_54FAF5B0_AB1F_4D4B_8DD6_4EB27BAB9EC3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Piles of human garbage, the three of them."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫まったく本当に、⟪k:1⟫あの三人衆はくずもいいとこだわ。"

#: omake:omake_4A3B06DA_3318_4B85_897A_EFAC99CB3699
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 22716a3323fac878e8c1f85174a466aea0d7de921284d9f596cea0b754033746
#. default-sha256: 381c6ac8d4161549fbd081e85e7184b402318095cc16839f173b847f4be8e46a
msgctxt "omake:omake_4A3B06DA_3318_4B85_897A_EFAC99CB3699"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫..................⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Wha?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫………………えっ。"

#: omake:omake_AF459C50_7428_4E06_B52B_E61DDFA1FC42
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9a29c88566037f5a9ad566dd60ad1d6323a0db88775496a10ca380e9dd53e53a
#. default-sha256: aea3d755f70c187d4b0493d0ba339bb802ab365c99afc87b8425743017a768ff
msgctxt "omake:omake_AF459C50_7428_4E06_B52B_E61DDFA1FC42"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I, ⟪k:2⟫um... ⟪k:3⟫wasn’t expecting something so...⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫flattering to come out of "
"your mouth..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫いや……、⟪k:2⟫そんな良い言葉を向けられるとは思っていなかった……。"

#: omake:omake_015D16D7_B9C9_4D89_A4A6_0559A858ADB1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 32a69be653e1e647430ef2a14b55290c347d9922d8c759cf8234af384b82084c
#. default-sha256: 87e9bf24f271b2c1b0a3117febd2f66df9aefd5e4e458df265c749f23b8b3bd9
msgctxt "omake:omake_015D16D7_B9C9_4D89_A4A6_0559A858ADB1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫That’s true.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Putting a knife to a woman’s neck isn’t very righteous."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫そうね、⟪k:3⟫女にナイフを向けるのはどうかと思うわ。"

#: omake:omake_C5E64966_43BC_4099_8D0D_6DA0BD579942
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0f7318ee7afac5a962f3603e406374c9e9895d7ac75d2f24210a12b2b67feb5c
#. default-sha256: 75c70c218f489347771f982a0e355d21e423c215a1956c427de28ecf2ccfbc0b
msgctxt "omake:omake_C5E64966_43BC_4099_8D0D_6DA0BD579942"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Anyway. While those are the core aspects of your character, they got buried over "
"the course of the abuse and misfortune you suffered throughout the story."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫まあ、⟪k:3⟫そういう根本の性質はありますけど、⟪k:4⟫色々と酷な目に遭ってそれが隠され"
"ていたわけです。"

#: omake:omake_EF314AA7_C3E8_4D12_87F4_B33DAA747E3B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 88956d121b6537be7fa2d7eaf556173dbaaaed6a4cd9994a17f0f4fea343cff7
#. default-sha256: 614c62d752f0b1f2d61725e9d99bcfd82a669b7615bde3757058638f7765e712
msgctxt "omake:omake_EF314AA7_C3E8_4D12_87F4_B33DAA747E3B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫How all the promotional material portrays me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫公式の私に対する扱い。"

#: omake:omake_1BE9E555_DCC5_4A99_AF04_16EBAFE32490
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf8ee3efedbd94788191a92dfccda20d85ac3faf5534dd14857c6272bc59ceee
#. default-sha256: e1596a9b855abf227e134884946cdb367e454093f57402d0bbddc4d5291fc3c4
msgctxt "omake:omake_1BE9E555_DCC5_4A99_AF04_16EBAFE32490"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Well, it ⟪k:3⟫was⟪k:4⟫ the demo.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫I’m sure they just didn’t want to spoil "
